0 &= 1 + \sqrt{76}t_2 - \frac{1}{2}(10)t_2^2 \\
5t_2^2 - \sqrt{76}t_2 - 1 &= 0
\end{align*}

Aplicamos la fórmula general:
\begin{align*}
t_2 &= \frac{\sqrt{76} \pm \sqrt{(-\sqrt{76})^2 - 4(5)(-1)}}{2(5)} \\
t_2 &= \frac{\sqrt{76} \pm \sqrt{76 + 20}}{10} \\
